"corresponds to all the default configurations of the prefix, which (as the "
"disabled _Remove application_ button implies) cannot be deleted."
msgstr "_Applications_ 标签页包含用于将程序与特定版本 Windows(R) 关联的控件。首次启动时，_Application settings_ 区域中只有一个条目：_Default Settings_。它对应前缀的所有默认配置；正如禁用的 _Remove application_ 按钮所示，该条目无法删除。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/wine/_index.adoc:397
msgid "But additional applications can be added with the following process:"
msgstr "但是，可以使用以下过程添加其他应用程序："

#. type: Plain text
